{"obsah":"<p>Sunday was literally like the famous Czech film Ball Lightning. 3 teams, 5 locations, 6 shows and two stops swapping riders. An incredible onslaught, where one or two mishaps would have made everything collapse like a house of cards.</p>\n\n<p>In the morning our host dropped out because of a voice problem, so Vlasta had to host the exhibition at Great-Grandpa's Tractor, contrary to plan. Every cloud has a silver lining, and thanks to little Márty, whom he took along, the exhibition was ridden with 3 riders straight away. From Čáslav we went to Bratronice near Kladno, where Martin Šimůnek with Vlasta and Petr Jeřicha – who almost didn't make it because his car broke down – ran a workshop and an exhibition. The Kabeláč sisters helped too, joining in the riding.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>In the end the Čáslav squad also arrived in Bratronice, the riders were reshuffled, and Lukáš Valný, Vlasta, the girls and Tobík Dolák set off for a children's day in Choteč. Martin Šimůnek and Matouš, on the other hand, went to Suchdol for the local sports festival. Petr Jeřicha took his car to be serviced, and meanwhile in Moravia Mára Tryner and Michal Budský were warming up at Slavex bike park before the exhibition in Bojkovice.</p>\n\n<p>Beautiful weather and great turnouts at all events were refreshing and motivating for us. Vlasta and Tobík even managed a short training session in the forest afterwards. Next weekend we continue at a slightly more relaxed pace. Thanks to all the organisers for the invitations and to the riders for their performances. We have a video from Mára and Michal in the article :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/UCMrfWy6utg\n</div></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8263.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8263.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237455\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8274.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8274.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237456\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8284.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8284.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237457\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8285.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8285.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237458\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8287.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F06%2FDSC_8287.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237459\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https